  "question": {
    "text": "If the normal to the ellipse <math><msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math> at a point <math><mi>P</mi></math> on it is parallel to the line, <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and the tangent to the ellipse at <math><mi>P</mi></math> passes through <math><mi>Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>4,4</mn><mo>)</mo></math> then <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is equal to:",
